WEBVTT

00:31:00.288 --> 00:31:02.746
then they tend to give you
a different answers.

00:31:02.913 --> 00:31:08.371
And the average of the answers is more
accurate than each of them separately.

00:31:08.454 --> 00:31:13.996
Also, in the case that the first answer
is more valid than the second,

00:31:14.204 --> 00:31:19.163
and it's also the case, the longer you
wait, the better the average is,

00:31:19.329 --> 00:31:23.579
the more information there is in the
second judgment that you make.

00:31:24.246 --> 00:31:31.038
You know, what it indicates is clearly
that what we come up with when we ask